umb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5423775?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":250,"thumb_height":250,"from_url":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/pull/252/files#diff-4be8f90b3d810cf98842e6412aff4267d3288de5a257924c60d0cc342d177d61R22-R36","original_url":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/pull/252/files#diff-4be8f90b3d810cf98842e6412aff4267d3288de5a257924c60d0cc342d177d61R22-R36"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4GHl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcf0486b-890e-4bb6-b882-e99cc2d4ad54","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"items() と map() ですかねぇ","ts":"1614819249.381400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PUIj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"964a26e9-ddf3-42a3-b42f-9d902c2654fe","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なんかちょっと取りたいものと違う気がするけどこれしかないんだろうか","ts":"1614817970.380900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TwY"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nitems({dict})                                           *items()*\n                {dict}の全要素のキー・値のペアからなるリストを返す。戻り値の各\n                要素はリストであり、キーと値の2個の要素を持つ。戻り値のリスト\n                の要素の順序は不定である。|keys()| と |values()| も参照。\n                例:  \n                        for [key, value] in items(mydict)\n                           echo key . ': ' . value\n                        endfor\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        mydict-\u0026gt;items()\n \njob_ 関数群はここに文書化されている: |job-functions-details|\n```","ts":"1614817914.380600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"e324ec1b-16e3-43ac-a2a6-24be0b159f1a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"itemsかな？\n:h items","ts":"1614817913.380500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uww7c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96925e59-d0a5-4530-ba84-115b853e808b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"オブジェクトの変換について質問です\n```{\n  'alias': [\n    {'lnum': 135, 'tagfile': 'src/type/fzf.ts', 'taginfo': 'export type AddFzfArg = ReadonlyDeep\u0026lt;{', 'text': 'AddFzfArg'},\n    {'lnum': 28, 'tagfile': 'src/store/index.ts', 'taginfo': 'export type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch', 'text': 'AppDispatch'}\n  ],\n  ...\n}```\nを\n```[\n  {'kind': 'alias', 'lnum': 135, 'tagfile': 'src/type/fzf.ts', 'taginfo': 'export type AddFzfArg = ReadonlyDeep\u0026lt;{', 'text': 'AddFzfArg'},\n  {'kind': 'alias', 'lnum': 28, 'tagfile': 'src/store/index.ts', 'taginfo': 'export type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch', 'text': 'AppDispatch'},\n  ...\n]```\nにしたいんですが、Vim scriptだとどういった書き方がよさそうでしょうか\nTSなら色々思いつくんですがVim scriptだとどの辺を使えばいいのかいまいちわからず・・・","ts":"1614817580.380000","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1614817619.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0km"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d8d6ab0-afd0-4ac3-a79a-9c43b7b30c85","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分は全部を展開する必要はないので、必要なのだけaltercmdしています","ts":"1614816492.378700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yQJ3o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a278b099-3a8a-4888-bcac-5fb93c22bbbb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ぱっと見死にそうな気がする・・・","ts":"1614816454.378200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X8ml"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2fa488b-a167-4ca7-b27f-a28f567331ea","type":"message","user":"U7986PPFH","text":"`ambicmd#expand(\"\\\u0026lt;space\u0026gt;\")` で展開する場合","ts":"1614816449.378000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original"